{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"平\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：两版话文和高亮词完全相同，主要情节、人物心境及前后串联没有区别。small、fine：Y明显更好，例如“眼前的好还在，心里却先有一点鼻酸”“还没有失去什么，就已经舍不得”，比X反复使用“很安心”“很激动”等标签更具体，也更能留下甜中带痛的体验；不过Y有些感受转向了音乐本身。core、load：X的亲密、渴望、害怕失去和最终不再隐藏喜欢这条线更突出，Y大量左手、右手、内声部、颤音等描述及长篇比喻容易分散注意力，尤其S02、S04、S07、S11至S14，扫读负担明显更大。concise：X有重复情绪标签的问题，Y则有同屏多层铺陈、部分意思复述的问题，长短与重复各有得失，判平。human：X胜，Y有“身体恢复弹性”“进入终结句”“不安还没回答”“身体仿佛可以交给船底托举”等搭配或表达不够自然的问题，部分文字也偏音乐说明腔。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e600c8f1-9373-4512-b930-2a91f31a9811", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T135656425874Z", "elapsed_seconds": 249.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T14:01:05.995819+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "20842dc44ea5a950601205acbb05581c88cb0e207fda32ed31ca189bc5b07178", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee4